  "website_about_raw": "SOURCE: https://www.kellylahl.com/\nKelly Lahl 0 Skip to Content Home Work About Journal SHOP Contact Open Menu Close Menu Open Menu Close Menu Home Work About Journal SHOP Contact Home Folder: Work Back Folder: About Back Journal SHOP Contact New Artwork: Charcoal New in the shop, an exploration of charcoal in all variations. Textures, stripes, and abstracted florals get an edgy charcoal look. SHOP EXCLUSIVE ARTWORK Contemporary Print Design for Fashion & Lifestyle About Kelly I’m a US based designer creating textile print design for contemporary fashion and lifestyle brands. In a world saturated with artificial digital creation, there is something very special about hand-painted art. Most of my prints begin as paintings or drawings on paper, where I experiment with a wide range of analog media. This process creates distinctive artwork with a human touch. I blend my hand-painting with digital design techniques. Artwork is digitized, further refined, and developed into production-ready designs using Adobe Photoshop. Subscribe See what’s been happening in the studio. News, trends, inspiration and more. First Name Last Name Email Address GET QUARTERLY UPDATES Thank you! New in the Journal: Visiting a Peony Farm JOURNAL CONTACT JOURNAL PRINT COLLECTION Copyright © Kelly Lahl Design LLC. All rights reserved. PRIVACY POLICY TERMS OF USE\n\nSOURCE: https://www.kellylahl.com/work\nWork 0 Skip to Content Home Work About Journal SHOP Contact Open Menu Close Menu Open Menu Close Menu Home Work About Journal SHOP Contact Home Folder: Work Back Folder: About Back Journal SHOP Contact This folder does not contain any pages. CONTACT JOURNAL PRINT COLLECTION Copyright © Kelly Lahl Design LLC. All rights reserved. PRIVACY POLICY TERMS OF USE\n\nSOURCE: https://www.kellylahl.com/about\nJournal 0 Skip to Content Home Work About Journal SHOP Contact Open Menu Close Menu Open Menu Close Menu Home Work About Journal SHOP Contact Home Folder: Work Back Folder: Abo